.TH AVR\-HEALTH 1 "" "avr 0.1.5" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-health \- Check Avrea platform status.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr health
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check Avrea platform status.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
Examples:
    avr health
    avr health --json status
    avr health --json '*' -q '.status'
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
